 duration-300\"><div class=\"p-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-6\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-orange-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center\"><span class=\"text-lg font-bold text-orange-700\">1</span></div></div><div class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900\">آگاهی (Awareness)</h3><div class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 text-xs font-semibold transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 border-transparent hover:bg-primary/80 bg-blue-100 text-blue-700\">۱۰۰%</div></div><p class=\"text-gray-600 mb-3\">شناخت نیاز و معرفی برند</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-2\"><div class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 font-semibold transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 text-foreground text-sm\">محتوای آموزشی</div><div class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 font-semibold transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 text-foreground text-sm\">سوشال مدیا</div><div class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full border px-2.5 py-0.5 font-semibold transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-ring focus:ring-offset-2 text-foreground text-sm\">تبلیغات</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"rounded-lg border bg-card text-card-foreground shadow-sm hover:shadow-lg transition-all duration-300\"><div class=\"p-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-6\"><div class=\"flex-shrink-0\"><div class=\"w-12 h-12 bg-orange-100 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center\"><span class=\"text-lg font-bold text-orange-700\">2</span></div></div><div class=\"flex-1\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between mb-2\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-semibold text-gray-900\">علاقه‌مندی (Interest)</h3><div class=\"inline-flex items-center rounded-full bor